+# No Payne fork of AdamRMS
+
+This is No Payne Productions' fork of [AdamRMS](https://github.com/adam-rms/adam-rms), run at
+our AdamRMS instance. It adds one feature, **per-project access control**, so an outside client can have an
+account that only sees and changes the project(s) they are on.
+
+## 1. Purpose, base version and branches
+
+- **Why:** stock AdamRMS's `PROJECTS:VIEW` is business-wide. Without it a user gets a 404 on every project, even
+  ones they are crew on. With it they see every project, client and the whole inventory. We needed a client
+  account (an outside client) that can see only its own project, see the gear and prices on it, and add and remove
+  gear.
+- **Base version:** upstream release tag `v1.205.6` (commit `2e76a3da`).
+- **Remotes:** `origin` = `jopdop30/adam-rms` (this fork), `upstream` = `adam-rms/adam-rms`.
+- **Branches:**
+  - `main` tracks `upstream/main` unchanged. Never commit our work to it.
+  - `nopayne` = an upstream release tag plus our patches. Production images are built from tags on this branch.
+  - Feature branches (e.g. `feature/project-scoped-access`) are merged into `nopayne` by pull request.
+
+## 2. Files changed or added
+
